WEBVTT

01:35.900 --> 01:38.289
[Too Young To Love]

01:38.500 --> 01:41.280
[Episode 10]

01:53.789 --> 01:54.590
Go over there!

01:56.890 --> 01:57.690
Go over there!

02:15.490 --> 02:16.010
I heard

02:16.050 --> 02:17.910
his son is head over heels in debt.

02:18.270 --> 02:20.240
I heard
he even sold his house in the city.

02:20.240 --> 02:21.010
I heard his daughter

02:21.010 --> 02:22.570
also came back with a huge debt.

02:22.570 --> 02:24.240
What a terrible tragedy.

02:25.230 --> 02:26.690
Anything else new lately?

02:28.730 --> 02:29.840
What's going on?

02:30.120 --> 02:31.250
Why are we out of gas?

02:32.490 --> 02:34.950
Chen Fan, you went the wrong way,
didn't you?

02:35.010 --> 02:36.240
Look at the map.

02:37.070 --> 02:38.410
This isn't the place.

02:38.880 --> 02:40.760
Can our car still run?

02:40.780 --> 02:42.110
We're screwed.

02:42.250 --> 02:43.570
We can't be stuck here,

02:43.600 --> 02:45.680
and we definitely can't spend the night
here.

02:45.680 --> 02:47.280
In the end, you still need me.

02:47.930 --> 02:48.730
You have a way?

02:52.060 --> 02:52.750
Shan.

02:53.980 --> 02:55.120
Our car ran out of gas.

02:55.120 --> 02:56.850
We're in the middle of nowhere.

02:57.010 --> 02:58.010
What should we do?

02:58.160 --> 02:59.620
Send me your location quickly.

02:59.620 --> 03:00.470
Wait for me on the road.

03:00.470 --> 03:01.730
-I'm coming to pick you up.
-Okay. Thank you, Shan.

03:01.730 --> 03:03.460
I'll send you the location now.

03:03.850 --> 03:05.230
I'm so thirsty.

03:06.240 --> 03:07.320
Take out the drinks.

03:07.320 --> 03:08.010
No, no.

03:08.210 --> 03:09.210
These are for Ning.

03:09.210 --> 03:10.010
No one is allowed to drink them first.

03:10.010 --> 03:10.560
Who...

03:10.560 --> 03:11.360
Whoever touches them

03:11.360 --> 03:12.090
is a traitor.

03:12.800 --> 03:14.050
You're so mean!

03:14.170 --> 03:15.080
We're dying of thirst,

03:15.080 --> 03:16.510
and you still won't let us drink!

03:16.510 --> 03:17.930
Open the car door!

03:17.930 --> 03:18.800
Don't run!

03:24.040 --> 03:25.050
There are fruits!

03:25.090 --> 03:26.350
Let's pick some to eat!

03:37.560 --> 03:38.890
This one isn't ripe yet, is it?

03:38.890 --> 03:40.160
I want the biggest one.

03:44.210 --> 03:46.360
You're really treating me like Guowei?

03:46.360 --> 03:46.770
Move aside.

03:46.770 --> 03:47.770
I'll do it myself.

03:59.840 --> 04:00.300
Come on.

04:06.540 --> 04:07.300
Be careful.

04:13.520 --> 04:14.600
I can't reach it.

04:17.610 --> 04:18.820
Go a bit higher.

04:32.800 --> 04:34.000
It hurts!

04:35.240 --> 04:36.760
What are you two doing?

04:39.400 --> 04:40.950
Thank god you broke my fall.

04:41.050 --> 04:41.820
Thanks.

04:46.880 --> 04:48.210
We were picking fruits!

04:52.680 --> 04:53.610
Chen Fan, are you gonna pick some or not?

04:53.610 --> 04:54.150
If you don't,

04:54.150 --> 04:55.800
I'll drink all the drinks in your car.

04:55.800 --> 04:56.400
I'll pick.

05:11.800 --> 05:12.760
Look at you.

05:13.050 --> 05:15.240
You don't even rest during summer break.

05:15.240 --> 05:16.300
You don't need

05:16.360 --> 05:17.880
to do these chores.

05:18.360 --> 05:20.440
Just having you here with me

05:20.680 --> 05:22.680
is more than enough to make me happy.

05:34.240 --> 05:34.930
Grandma.

05:35.290 --> 05:37.220
The two of us can't possibly finish

05:37.230 --> 05:38.240
such a big pot, can we?

05:38.240 --> 05:40.800
Go to the village committee
and see who's there.

05:40.800 --> 05:43.120
Invite them all over
for some mung bean soup.

05:43.120 --> 05:44.980
It's more fun with people around.

05:46.290 --> 05:47.000
Grandma,

05:47.200 --> 05:48.409
you have some first.

05:53.120 --> 05:53.930
Go.

05:54.880 --> 05:55.409
Go.

06:09.880 --> 06:10.680
Who are you people?

06:10.680 --> 06:12.210
You're stealing my fruits!

06:13.170 --> 06:14.940
How could you pick so many?

06:15.360 --> 06:15.880
This...

06:18.200 --> 06:19.070
Village Chief!

06:19.120 --> 06:21.050
These people showed up out of nowhere.

06:21.050 --> 06:23.080
They picked a whole load of fruits
from my tree

06:23.080 --> 06:24.670
and even damaged the branches!

06:24.670 --> 06:26.270
Everyone, be the judge here!

06:26.490 --> 06:28.120
So they're thieves stealing things.

06:28.120 --> 06:29.050
I say let it go.

06:29.160 --> 06:30.610
It's not your tree.
Of course you'd say that.

06:30.610 --> 06:31.440
Ma'am,

06:31.490 --> 06:33.420
we really didn't know these fruits

06:33.440 --> 06:34.680
belonged to you.

06:35.050 --> 06:35.880
Ma'am?

06:36.000 --> 06:36.560
You...

06:36.560 --> 06:37.440
Who are you calling Ma'am?

06:37.440 --> 06:38.560
Miss.

06:39.000 --> 06:40.930
How about this?

06:41.000 --> 06:42.230
You name your price.

06:42.320 --> 06:44.930
We'll pay full price,

06:44.930 --> 06:45.810
or even double.

06:49.680 --> 06:52.560
-You think money can solve everything?
-You think money can solve everything?

06:52.560 --> 06:53.680
Ma'am.

06:54.760 --> 06:55.800
Miss.

06:55.930 --> 06:57.360
We've already apologized

06:57.360 --> 06:58.440
and said we'll pay for it.

06:58.440 --> 06:58.930
You...

06:59.200 --> 07:00.440
What more do you want?

07:00.970 --> 07:02.550
What's with that attitude?

07:02.610 --> 07:03.680
You think apologizing

07:03.680 --> 07:05.810
and paying up makes everything right?

07:05.930 --> 07:06.560
Then...

07:06.560 --> 07:07.760
Just let it go.

07:07.800 --> 07:10.090
What do you want us to do?

07:11.240 --> 07:12.440
You're the only one here

07:12.440 --> 07:13.300
talking sense.

07:14.880 --> 07:15.680
I'm furious.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.240
Village Chief, you tell me.

07:18.240 --> 07:19.360
How should this be handled?

07:19.360 --> 07:20.240
I say let it go.

07:21.000 --> 07:22.120
Ning.

07:24.320 --> 07:24.800
Aunt.

07:25.190 --> 07:27.190
They are my high school classmates.

07:27.560 --> 07:28.780
They definitely didn't know

07:28.780 --> 07:30.280
the fruit trees belonged to someone.

07:30.280 --> 07:31.040
Otherwise,

07:31.070 --> 07:32.640
they wouldn't have damaged the branches.

07:32.640 --> 07:34.500
Just take their money and move on.

07:36.170 --> 07:37.159
How come Luo Ningzi has

07:37.159 --> 07:37.960
such an aunt?

07:38.880 --> 07:39.680
I don't know.

07:39.710 --> 07:40.650
My grandma made

07:40.650 --> 07:42.000
mung bean soup for everyone back home.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.440
Why don't we go drink some mung bean soup,

07:43.440 --> 07:44.159
cool down a bit,

07:44.159 --> 07:45.380
and then figure out what to do.

07:45.380 --> 07:46.230
I'm not going!

07:46.680 --> 07:47.970
This is really out of line.

07:47.970 --> 07:48.970
Or how about this?

07:49.000 --> 07:50.460
We can help you

07:50.680 --> 07:51.360
with some work.

07:51.360 --> 07:52.420
We can do anything.

07:52.730 --> 07:53.409
Work?

07:54.070 --> 07:54.930
What can you do?

07:55.030 --> 07:56.210
Look at your skinny little arms and legs.

07:56.210 --> 07:57.450
What can you do?

07:58.360 --> 07:59.240
No way.

07:59.240 --> 08:00.490
You're joking.

08:00.490 --> 08:01.880
You're

08:01.880 --> 08:02.880
all grown-ups.

08:02.880 --> 08:04.680
Why are you so hard on these kids?

08:04.780 --> 08:06.380
Come home with me, all of you.

08:07.880 --> 08:08.680
I'm not going.

08:09.000 --> 08:10.000
-Enough.
-Yaogu.

08:10.240 --> 08:12.000
Come back with me
and have some mung bean soup.

08:12.000 --> 08:12.560
Alright. Go home.

08:12.560 --> 08:13.240
Just go home.

08:13.240 --> 08:13.800
Go home, everyone.

08:13.800 --> 08:14.320
Break it up!

08:14.320 --> 08:14.680
Go home!

08:14.680 --> 08:15.240
Go home!

08:15.240 --> 08:15.800
Go home!

08:15.800 --> 08:16.490
Go home for dinner!

08:16.490 --> 08:17.320
Alright.

08:17.350 --> 08:18.320
Everyone, go home!

08:18.320 --> 08:18.800
Ning.

08:18.980 --> 08:20.860
Why didn't you reply to my messages?

08:20.860 --> 08:22.200
You didn't pick up my calls either!

08:22.200 --> 08:22.950
Luo Ningzi,

08:23.000 --> 08:24.440
how can you have an aunt like that?

08:24.440 --> 08:26.120
She was describing us
as skinny arms and legs?

08:26.120 --> 08:27.780
She was calling us weaklings!

08:45.600 --> 08:46.170
Hello.

08:48.200 --> 08:49.260
Where are you guys?

08:52.590 --> 08:53.590
What should we do?

08:54.040 --> 08:55.640
Do you think Ning is mad at us?

09:21.210 --> 09:22.740
Actually, I'm not thirsty.

09:33.350 --> 09:34.140
Spit it out.

09:34.870 --> 09:35.900
Why on earth did you come

09:35.900 --> 09:37.160
to my grandma's house?

09:40.140 --> 09:42.140
We didn't mean to come here.

09:42.140 --> 09:43.140
I was taking everyone

09:43.140 --> 09:44.870
to visit my relatives.

09:44.870 --> 09:47.870
-And then the car ran out of...
-Keep making things up.

09:48.140 --> 09:49.710
Ning, you didn't reply to my messages.

09:49.710 --> 09:51.350
We all really missed you.

09:51.350 --> 09:52.380
Yeah.

09:52.380 --> 09:53.380
We missed you so much.

09:53.380 --> 09:54.990
Now the car is out of gas.

09:54.990 --> 09:55.500
Yeah.

09:55.500 --> 09:57.030
It's stuck by the roadside.

09:57.500 --> 09:58.380
So we...

09:59.110 --> 09:59.740
Right!

09:59.740 --> 10:01.140
Our car is out of gas.

10:01.140 --> 10:02.740
-Can we stay at your...
-No.

10:03.590 --> 10:05.140
My grandma's home. It's not convenient.

10:05.140 --> 10:06.110
Looks like tonight

10:06.110 --> 10:07.770
we'll have to sleep in the car.

10:08.870 --> 10:09.990
You silly child.

10:09.990 --> 10:11.590
They came all this way to see you.

10:11.590 --> 10:13.260
Just let them stay the night.

10:14.470 --> 10:15.620
Make yourselves at home.

10:15.620 --> 10:16.680
All of you can stay.

10:17.230 --> 10:17.740
Okay.

10:17.740 --> 10:18.710
Thank you.

10:19.780 --> 10:20.620
Grandma!

10:22.110 --> 10:22.620
Oh no.

10:22.620 --> 10:24.280
The stuff I prepared for Ning!

10:25.140 --> 10:26.110
Here it is.

10:26.890 --> 10:29.110
Shan, you're finally here.

10:32.230 --> 10:33.140
Your dad called you so many times.

10:33.140 --> 10:34.400
Why didn't you answer?

10:35.110 --> 10:36.440
I didn't check my phone.

10:38.620 --> 10:39.020
I...

10:39.020 --> 10:39.780
Oh no.

10:39.990 --> 10:42.120
My dad just told me to go back right now.

10:43.110 --> 10:44.110
How about this?

10:44.470 --> 10:45.620
I'll talk to your dad.

10:45.620 --> 10:47.470
I'll stay the night with you guys.

10:47.470 --> 10:48.230
Great!

10:48.870 --> 10:50.380
Shan, you're the best!

10:50.380 --> 10:52.040
I'll go with you to call my dad.

10:52.740 --> 10:54.020
Ning.

11:20.870 --> 11:22.000
You're still awake?

11:31.990 --> 11:33.190
Looking at the stars?

11:36.740 --> 11:38.740
The stars here are so bright.

11:39.350 --> 11:40.260
Well,

11:40.740 --> 11:41.590
is it possible

11:41.590 --> 11:43.870
that the stars in the city
are actually bright too,

11:43.870 --> 11:45.530
but the lights are too strong,

11:45.660 --> 11:46.870
so everyone just

11:48.260 --> 11:49.460
overlooks the stars?

11:55.110 --> 11:56.440
Did you see my messages?

11:56.740 --> 11:58.400
I got into Hailan University.

11:58.620 --> 11:59.420
How about you?

12:00.230 --> 12:01.290
Congratulations.

12:01.500 --> 12:02.140
Me too.

12:03.020 --> 12:04.020
That's great.

12:04.380 --> 12:05.380
Maybe we'll end up

12:05.400 --> 12:06.400
in the same class,

12:06.590 --> 12:07.790
or even the same dorm.

12:08.230 --> 12:08.570
Yeah.

12:10.470 --> 12:12.740
How are you doing here?

12:13.140 --> 12:14.890
If you need any help,

12:14.990 --> 12:15.920
just let us know.

12:16.870 --> 12:18.130
I'm doing pretty well.

12:18.230 --> 12:18.990
Really.

12:19.170 --> 12:21.260
Grandma runs a small business
in the village,

12:21.260 --> 12:22.370
so I came to help out,

12:22.370 --> 12:24.740
making some money to cover living expenses
and tuition later.

12:24.740 --> 12:26.620
I'm gonna get a part-time job too
once I'm in college.

12:26.620 --> 12:27.990
We can do it together

12:27.990 --> 12:29.520
and look out for each other.

12:39.990 --> 12:40.620
Lan.

12:41.030 --> 12:41.390
Yeah?

12:41.950 --> 12:43.080
Actually, that day,

12:43.260 --> 12:45.190
I wanted to reply to your messages,

12:45.650 --> 12:47.270
but I was afraid you'd worry about me,

12:47.270 --> 12:48.630
so I didn't contact you.

12:50.620 --> 12:51.870
But I'm really glad

12:51.870 --> 12:53.020
that you came to see me.

12:53.020 --> 12:53.620
Thank you.

12:53.620 --> 12:54.870
It's nothing.

12:54.870 --> 12:56.020
We're good friends.

13:11.660 --> 13:13.120
That one is the brightest.

13:35.380 --> 13:36.440
I'm picking first.

13:48.380 --> 13:49.180
I'll take you.

13:49.260 --> 13:50.020
The trash in our greenhouse

13:50.020 --> 13:50.740
needs to be collected.

13:50.740 --> 13:51.270
Let's go.

13:52.620 --> 13:53.480
Take your time.

14:00.350 --> 14:00.990
This girl is great.

14:00.990 --> 14:02.650
Come with me to herd the sheep.

14:07.210 --> 14:08.620
This girl is so sharp.

14:08.620 --> 14:09.490
Come with me.

14:19.140 --> 14:21.140
My family doesn't need extra hands.

14:39.020 --> 14:40.140
Where are they?

14:43.500 --> 14:43.900
Well,

14:44.620 --> 14:45.820
do you have a gym here?

14:55.500 --> 14:56.620
Stop running!

14:56.620 --> 14:57.820
Why are you running?

15:00.140 --> 15:01.140
Come out!

15:02.500 --> 15:03.500
Stop running!

15:06.870 --> 15:08.230
Stop running!

15:10.620 --> 15:11.620
Come here.

16:13.870 --> 16:14.660
I've got a popsicle for you.

16:14.660 --> 16:15.790
It can cool you down.

16:15.790 --> 16:17.490
Do you have a death wish?

16:17.870 --> 16:18.650
Stop it!

16:18.870 --> 16:20.130
I just fixed my hair!

16:22.140 --> 16:22.870
Don't run!

16:22.870 --> 16:24.270
If you've got the guts...

16:26.260 --> 16:27.540
What are you doing?

16:28.350 --> 16:29.110
No!

16:30.140 --> 16:31.340
Stop messing around.

16:31.450 --> 16:32.620
I'm sorry!

16:32.620 --> 16:34.990
I caught a cute little lamb!

16:37.260 --> 16:38.870
Her task is way too good.

16:38.870 --> 16:40.270
I want to catch a lamb too!

16:49.870 --> 16:50.880
Um...

16:54.230 --> 16:55.370
What's wrong?

17:04.980 --> 17:06.069
He is so young,

17:06.069 --> 17:07.099
yet so capable.

17:07.220 --> 17:08.420
And he's so handsome.

17:08.619 --> 17:10.619
He'll drive countless girls crazy.

17:10.829 --> 17:11.550
Young man,

17:12.030 --> 17:13.310
what do you do for work?

17:13.619 --> 17:15.030
I'm a luthier.

17:15.420 --> 17:15.940
A luthier?

17:15.940 --> 17:16.460
A luthier?

17:16.460 --> 17:17.030
What's a luthier?

17:17.030 --> 17:17.869
A woodworker.

17:18.869 --> 17:19.420
Oh, I know that.

17:19.420 --> 17:20.310
That's a good job.

17:20.310 --> 17:20.900
I know what a woodworker is.

17:20.900 --> 17:21.550
Young man,

17:21.940 --> 17:23.869
how about I set you up with someone?

17:25.140 --> 17:25.790
Right.

17:25.790 --> 17:26.349
That's good.

17:26.349 --> 17:26.869
Young man,

17:26.869 --> 17:28.140
how many brothers do you have?

17:28.140 --> 17:29.310
Have you bought a car?

17:29.310 --> 17:30.140
Hey, quiet down.

17:30.140 --> 17:31.590
How much do you make a month?

17:31.590 --> 17:32.870
Let me tell you.

17:33.140 --> 17:34.310
I have a daughter.

17:34.310 --> 17:34.620
Lan.

17:34.620 --> 17:35.140
Come here.

17:35.140 --> 17:35.620
Come.

17:35.830 --> 17:36.900
Give me a hand.

17:37.550 --> 17:39.140
Let me finish.

17:39.180 --> 17:39.830
My daughter

17:39.830 --> 17:40.460
is a teacher.

17:40.460 --> 17:41.420
You two look

17:41.420 --> 17:42.590
perfect for each other.

17:42.590 --> 17:43.590
Just say I'm your girlfriend.

17:43.590 --> 17:43.870
If you like her...

17:43.870 --> 17:44.350
Right!

17:44.620 --> 17:45.140
Sorry.

17:45.380 --> 17:45.940
Ladies,

17:46.140 --> 17:47.270
I have a girlfriend.

17:47.400 --> 17:48.940
-Really.
-You have a girlfriend?

17:48.940 --> 17:50.140
Is it serious?

17:50.310 --> 17:51.870
Isn't it obvious?

17:51.870 --> 17:53.920
His girlfriend is sitting right there.

17:53.920 --> 17:54.940
Stop being so nosy.

17:54.940 --> 17:55.790
Well...

17:56.310 --> 17:57.790
Are you just saying that
because you're not

17:57.790 --> 17:59.310
interested in my daughter?

17:59.310 --> 17:59.700
No!

17:59.700 --> 18:01.230
I really am his girlfriend.

18:02.070 --> 18:03.350
You've worked so hard.

18:04.380 --> 18:05.640
You've worked so hard.

18:06.070 --> 18:07.030
So clingy!

18:07.070 --> 18:08.030
Come back.

18:15.550 --> 18:16.420
It's so heavy.

18:17.700 --> 18:18.420
Lan.

18:19.110 --> 18:19.550
Perfect timing.

18:19.550 --> 18:20.750
Can you give me a hand?

18:21.700 --> 18:22.900
Stop messing around.

18:25.180 --> 18:26.240
Pass me the hammer.

18:36.870 --> 18:38.110
That young man's got it made.

18:38.110 --> 18:38.620
That young man?

18:38.620 --> 18:39.110
Yeah.

18:41.620 --> 18:42.950
It looks serious.

18:43.030 --> 18:44.830
Do you need to go to the hospital?

18:45.100 --> 18:45.690
I'm fine.

18:46.380 --> 18:47.780
It'll get better in a bit.

18:51.380 --> 18:52.140
What were you

18:52.830 --> 18:54.690
talking about with Shan just now?

18:56.790 --> 18:57.990
I was helping him out.

18:58.350 --> 18:59.280
Helping him out?

19:00.700 --> 19:02.300
Didn't you see those ladies?

19:07.830 --> 19:08.590
What's wrong?

19:08.590 --> 19:10.520
Why are you looking at me like that?

19:14.380 --> 19:15.940
Who is Shan's girlfriend?

19:16.070 --> 19:17.550
Shan doesn't have a girlfriend.

19:17.550 --> 19:18.620
What if he does?

19:18.790 --> 19:19.870
He doesn't.

19:20.110 --> 19:21.660
I know him well enough.

19:21.660 --> 19:22.660
Are you that sure?

19:23.460 --> 19:24.380
Yes.

19:30.540 --> 19:31.380
Then do you know

19:31.380 --> 19:33.220
why Shan went back

19:33.220 --> 19:34.380
in such a hurry?

19:35.180 --> 19:35.980
I don't know.

19:36.380 --> 19:37.330
Maybe

19:37.420 --> 19:38.870
he just has his own plans.

19:42.620 --> 19:43.950
Yi Lan, do you like Shan?

19:46.460 --> 19:47.620
No, I don't.

19:48.310 --> 19:50.180
You're so nosy.

19:52.940 --> 19:54.140
Is your hand okay?

19:54.900 --> 19:55.550
It's fine.

19:55.550 --> 19:57.680
I'm just not very good at this work yet.

19:58.620 --> 19:59.680
You guys should go.

20:02.660 --> 20:04.220
I mean

20:04.750 --> 20:05.830
if you don't leave,

20:05.860 --> 20:07.520
they'll keep making you work.

20:09.140 --> 20:09.830
Ning.

20:11.030 --> 20:13.110
Tomorrow the village
is putting on a talent show.

20:13.110 --> 20:13.830
The village director

20:13.830 --> 20:14.870
will help the winner

20:14.870 --> 20:17.870
find suppliers
to sell their agricultural products.

20:18.030 --> 20:20.030
I'll go make some connections then.

20:22.140 --> 20:23.660
You guys aren't from the village.

20:23.660 --> 20:25.060
Better not get involved.

20:28.980 --> 20:29.980
It's just for fun.

20:30.310 --> 20:31.380
Have you heard the latest news?

20:31.380 --> 20:32.550
They say the son of that old lady's family

20:32.550 --> 20:34.150
lost a ton of money out there.

20:34.350 --> 20:36.110
Her granddaughter
didn't even get into college.

20:36.110 --> 20:36.730
Yeah.

20:37.380 --> 20:38.790
She's here hiding from debt.

20:38.790 --> 20:40.850
Look at all the drama in their family.

20:50.370 --> 20:51.860
You've all got it wrong!

20:52.030 --> 20:54.140
Luo Ningzi got into a top university

20:54.140 --> 20:55.870
with the highest scores in her major.

20:55.870 --> 20:57.030
She's got full scholarships

20:57.030 --> 20:58.350
left and right.

20:58.420 --> 20:59.700
She's amazing.

21:01.140 --> 21:02.900
So Ning is that outstanding!

21:04.070 --> 21:05.700
She's truly the pride of our village.

21:05.700 --> 21:06.550
The pride of our village.

21:06.550 --> 21:06.900
Yes.

21:07.310 --> 21:07.660
Yes.

21:11.620 --> 21:12.920
How did you know

21:12.980 --> 21:15.310
I was top in my major
and got scholarships?

21:15.620 --> 21:17.310
I couldn't reach you,

21:17.870 --> 21:19.270
and I was really worried,

21:19.380 --> 21:21.310
so I asked around about you.

21:22.070 --> 21:23.700
I just wanted to help you.

21:24.870 --> 21:25.510
I'm sorry.

21:28.070 --> 21:29.070
Why are you sorry?

21:30.110 --> 21:30.750
Thank you.

21:45.620 --> 21:46.220
What? What's going on?

21:46.220 --> 21:46.790
A big discovery!

21:46.790 --> 21:47.790
A huge discovery!

21:48.460 --> 21:49.920
I've got a huge discovery!

21:53.140 --> 21:54.620
It seems that Chen Fan and Ning

21:54.620 --> 21:55.950
are into each other now.

21:56.110 --> 21:57.030
What does that mean?

21:57.030 --> 21:58.110
What's "into each other" supposed to mean?

21:58.110 --> 21:59.870
It means they like each other!

22:04.120 --> 22:07.820
How come I didn't know
Ning likes Chen Fan?

22:10.220 --> 22:11.550
Many families here grow apples.

22:11.550 --> 22:12.750
Are the apples sweet?

22:13.620 --> 22:15.550
I'll wash some for you to try later.

22:17.030 --> 22:17.760
Sounds good.

22:17.870 --> 22:19.070
Told you so, didn't I?

22:20.460 --> 22:21.070
Chen Fan.

22:22.110 --> 22:22.640
Chen Fan!

22:33.460 --> 22:34.070
What's up?

22:35.030 --> 22:35.700
What were you and Luo Ningzi

22:35.700 --> 22:37.030
talking about just now?

22:37.620 --> 22:38.620
We were flirting.

22:40.590 --> 22:41.250
Luo Ningzi!

22:41.380 --> 22:41.950
Don't!

22:45.900 --> 22:46.660
Seriously,

22:46.870 --> 22:47.470
are you two

22:47.590 --> 22:48.460
together now?

22:50.790 --> 22:51.550
Not yet.

22:51.550 --> 22:52.140
Not really.

22:52.140 --> 22:52.620
But...

22:52.620 --> 22:53.940
What do you mean "not really"?

22:53.940 --> 22:55.620
Are you really serious about Ning?

22:55.620 --> 22:56.590
Don't you dare hurt her.

22:56.590 --> 22:57.180
You hear me?

22:57.180 --> 22:57.620
Yeah.

22:58.180 --> 22:59.350
Of course.

22:59.660 --> 23:00.380
I swear

23:00.660 --> 23:01.830
I will never do anything

23:01.830 --> 23:03.030
to hurt Ning.

23:03.140 --> 23:04.340
I will treat her well.

23:04.420 --> 23:05.240
If I'm lying

23:05.270 --> 23:06.400
even a little bit,

23:06.590 --> 23:08.190
may I be struck by lightning.

23:13.110 --> 23:13.590
Let's get back to

23:13.590 --> 23:14.830
tomorrow's competition.

23:14.830 --> 23:15.710
For tomorrow's competition,

23:15.710 --> 23:17.870
we must give it everything we've got,

23:18.030 --> 23:19.290
to actually help Ning!

23:24.150 --> 23:25.880
I've prepared a secret weapon.

23:36.030 --> 23:38.070
Fellow villagers,

23:38.220 --> 23:40.030
can I have your attention for a moment?

23:40.030 --> 23:41.700
When the performances start later,

23:41.700 --> 23:42.590
can you give them

23:42.590 --> 23:43.830
your warmest applause?

23:43.830 --> 23:44.310
What?

23:44.310 --> 23:44.940
What are you saying?

23:44.940 --> 23:45.620
I can't hear you.

23:45.620 --> 23:48.150
There'll be some great performances
in a bit!

23:49.030 --> 23:50.420
Why are you shouting so loud?

23:50.420 --> 23:51.590
I'm not deaf.

23:51.590 --> 23:52.830
Sorry.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.700
This is for you.

23:55.350 --> 23:57.110
Have a seat over there.

24:01.830 --> 24:03.140
Everyone, please quiet down now.

24:03.140 --> 24:04.310
Everyone, take your seats.

24:04.310 --> 24:05.230
The show

24:05.310 --> 24:06.460
is about to start.

24:06.830 --> 24:08.010
Let's applaud

24:08.070 --> 24:10.800
to welcome the first group
of young performers!

25:00.700 --> 25:01.870
That was good.

25:02.310 --> 25:03.420
Was it good?

25:09.740 --> 25:10.850
Thank you.

25:21.070 --> 25:22.140
Let's applaud

25:22.380 --> 25:24.380
to welcome the second group!

25:24.620 --> 25:25.790
Great!

26:29.830 --> 26:31.700
I'm starving!

26:31.700 --> 26:33.430
Let's go find something to eat!

26:34.140 --> 26:34.760
I'm starving!

26:34.760 --> 26:36.960
Is there anything to eat in the kitchen?

26:38.460 --> 26:39.140
Ning.

26:41.830 --> 26:43.430
Can we stay outside for a bit?

26:43.700 --> 26:45.500
Do you have something to tell me?

26:48.110 --> 26:48.900
I'm sorry.

26:49.070 --> 26:50.510
I was too naive about it.

26:51.620 --> 26:52.940
I didn't really help.

26:54.350 --> 26:56.210
But I'll keep trying to find a way.

26:57.200 --> 26:57.960
Don't worry.

26:58.410 --> 26:59.270
About the fruit,

26:59.270 --> 27:02.070
the village chief
has already made arrangements.

27:03.330 --> 27:04.700
Then I...

27:09.290 --> 27:10.620
Is there anything else?

27:15.830 --> 27:16.350
I...

27:17.940 --> 27:18.460
I...

27:19.220 --> 27:21.110
I do have something else to say.

27:27.230 --> 27:28.710
Let's talk in the yard.

27:48.940 --> 27:50.820
It's a bit chilly tonight.

27:51.790 --> 27:53.120
Put this over your legs.

27:54.080 --> 27:55.110
I'll do the same.

28:31.310 --> 28:32.620
The moon tonight

28:33.180 --> 28:34.640
is quite bright, isn't it?

28:36.340 --> 28:36.750
Yeah.

28:37.750 --> 28:38.750
It is.

28:42.940 --> 28:44.010
How about

28:44.710 --> 28:45.880
we go check what Lan

28:45.900 --> 28:47.300
and the others are doing?

28:48.020 --> 28:48.650
Wait.

28:52.700 --> 28:53.700
Congratulations

28:53.750 --> 28:55.150
on getting into college.

29:02.010 --> 29:02.770
Thanks.

29:04.010 --> 29:05.110
But this is

29:05.290 --> 29:06.370
too expensive.

29:06.670 --> 29:07.670
I can't accept it.

29:08.110 --> 29:08.750
Then...

29:09.590 --> 29:11.250
take it as your birthday gift.

29:11.310 --> 29:13.040
A birthday gift is okay, right?

29:18.320 --> 29:19.080
Maybe

29:19.100 --> 29:20.510
we should go inside now.

29:21.420 --> 29:22.460
I like you.

29:26.140 --> 29:26.660
I...

29:26.790 --> 29:27.790
like...

29:28.550 --> 29:29.180
you.

29:36.470 --> 29:39.260
♪ Dusk gently fell on the coastline ♪

29:39.810 --> 29:42.730
♪ The quietly passing breeze
gave the clouds a kiss ♪

29:43.200 --> 29:44.870
♪ The Earth keeps spinning round ♪

29:44.890 --> 29:46.610
♪ Painted with shades of romance ♪

29:47.110 --> 29:49.470
♪ That was the moment I met you ♪

29:48.550 --> 29:49.580
Actually,

29:49.820 --> 29:51.900
it doesn't matter if you say no.

29:50.140 --> 29:52.700
♪ Even mountains and seas
can't separate us ♪

29:53.350 --> 29:54.700
I just really want

29:53.400 --> 29:56.470
♪ I wish I could turn into a bird
to explore the world for you ♪

29:54.700 --> 29:55.180
to tell you

29:55.180 --> 29:55.620
I...

29:56.550 --> 29:57.510
I really, really,

29:57.070 --> 29:58.570
♪ The vast, boundless Milky Way ♪

29:57.660 --> 29:58.350
really,

29:58.610 --> 30:00.370
♪ Sings its tender serenade ♪

29:59.380 --> 30:00.350
really like you.

30:00.420 --> 30:02.500
♪ I can't live a second without you ♪

30:04.010 --> 30:07.210
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

30:04.380 --> 30:06.110
I want to do so many

30:07.140 --> 30:07.900
things for you.

30:07.290 --> 30:08.700
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

30:08.960 --> 30:11.880
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

30:09.070 --> 30:11.080
But please don't feel any pressure.

30:11.700 --> 30:12.630
I mean...

30:12.230 --> 30:16.290
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

30:15.030 --> 30:16.290
as long as it's for you,

30:16.870 --> 30:17.870
I'm happy.

30:17.160 --> 30:18.810
♪ All the stars surround you ♪

30:18.830 --> 30:20.570
♪ The moon smiles at you ♪

30:20.420 --> 30:21.460
So,

30:20.600 --> 30:23.690
♪ I give you all the good things
in the world ♪

30:23.900 --> 30:25.620
can you let me always

30:24.170 --> 30:25.770
♪ And the light in your eyes ♪

30:25.790 --> 30:27.780
♪ Shines like diamonds ♪

30:27.140 --> 30:28.220
stay by your side?

30:28.130 --> 30:30.930
♪ Drawing an exclamation mark
in my world ♪

30:31.050 --> 30:32.570
♪ The evening breeze embraces you ♪

30:32.590 --> 30:34.340
♪ And I run towards you ♪

30:34.400 --> 30:37.610
♪ I hear our passionate heartbeats ♪

30:38.210 --> 30:39.150
We're in the middle of nowhere.

30:39.150 --> 30:39.730
Where did you get

30:39.730 --> 30:40.850
such a fancy cake?

30:40.870 --> 30:42.030
Shan sent it here.

30:43.850 --> 30:44.940
Shan again.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.060
It won't light.

30:47.070 --> 30:47.800
Give it to me.

30:59.270 --> 30:59.940
This is the key moment.

30:59.940 --> 31:00.760
Quiet.

31:13.040 --> 31:16.430
♪ Looking forward
to the next beautiful dream ♪

31:16.480 --> 31:17.890
♪ I just want to be with you ♪

31:17.170 --> 31:17.820
Then...

31:18.150 --> 31:21.070
♪ To see the most romantic starry sky
together ♪

31:18.770 --> 31:20.070
let's give it a try.

31:21.250 --> 31:23.500
Happy birthday!

31:21.430 --> 31:25.420
♪ The evening breeze tells
heartfelt emotions ♪

31:23.530 --> 31:26.200
We saw everything!

31:27.030 --> 31:30.750
Happy birthday to you.

31:31.140 --> 31:34.570
Happy birthday to you.

31:34.870 --> 31:38.220
Happy birthday to you.

31:38.380 --> 31:39.380
Hurry!

31:39.380 --> 31:41.570
Happy birthday to you.

31:41.660 --> 31:44.090
Happy birthday to you.

31:44.180 --> 31:46.220
Happy birthday to you.

31:46.380 --> 31:49.200
Happy birthday to you.

31:49.350 --> 31:53.460
Happy birthday to you.

31:58.620 --> 32:00.300
Happy birthday, Luo Ningzi!

32:00.350 --> 32:01.030
May you have no worries,

32:01.030 --> 32:01.700
and be happy every day.

32:01.700 --> 32:02.700
Ning, may you

32:02.700 --> 32:04.420
achieve your dream one day.

32:09.030 --> 32:10.140
I hope you can

32:10.140 --> 32:11.670
always be true to yourself.

32:13.310 --> 32:14.140
Make a wish.
